<title>POLAND: LUBAWA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.31 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.38 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Sales		    3.09 vs   2.80</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.93 vs   1.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.12 vs   1.79</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.50 vs   2.00</p>
<p> Sales		   15.55 vs  15.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
